531-   hpcmips and algor, X(promemul)'s default calls `fatal` + `exit(1)` (`cpu_mips_instr.c:2649-2650`).  The arm has no
532-   CU0 or mode check.  On pmax, arc, sgi, evbmips and ps2 the same word reaches PROM emulation from user mode at any PC:
