						    "revision 2 di or ei opcode"
						    " used, but the %s process"
						    "or does not implement "
						    "such instructions. Only "
						    "printing this "
						    "warning once. ]\n",
						    cpu->cd.mips.cpu_type.name);
						warning_ei_di = 1;
